  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Every single video on this page was created with AI, including me, but the world just shifted.",
      "start": 0.28666664759318033,
      "end": 5.719999980926514
    },
    {
      "text": "While most people are still treating AI like a toy, a small group of insiders is using it to replace entire production teams with a single laptop.",
      "start": 5.833333333333333,
      "end": 12.099999618530275
    },
    {
      "text": "Creating AI content is the easy part. The real game, the thing that actually changes your life, is having a system that turns that content into money.",
      "start": 12.206666819254558,
      "end": 19.066666285196938
    },
    {
      "text": "That's why we built Flywheel. This isn't theory.",
      "start": 19.166666666666668,
      "end": 21.473333485921223
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a plug in places to build to scale. We give you the tools to connect up to five Instagram accounts in any niche you want.",
      "start": 21.566666666666666,
      "end": 27.060000610351562
    },
    {
      "text": "Promote your own business, your own products, or simply use our affiliate offers and let us handle the heavy lifting.",
      "start": 27.166667429606118,
      "end": 33.686667887369794
    },
    {
      "text": "If you choose to promote our products, we generate the content, you connect the accounts, and we give you the distribution system to dominate the feed.",
      "start": 33.8066660563151,
      "end": 40.26666514078776
    },
    {
      "text": "You set it up once, the system does the work. You can keep watching other people make money with AI or you can get the exact system they're using and start monetizing today.",
      "start": 40.37333348592122,
      "end": 49.619998931884766
    },
    {
      "text": "Right now, it's just $9 to get started, but that price won't stay there for long.",
      "start": 49.84000015258789,
      "end": 57.0999984741211
    },
    {
      "text": "Grab your spot. Join Flywheel before the window closes. See you inside.",
      "start": 57.21333058675131,
      "end": 60.166663614908856
    }
  ]
